 red='''# Final red-team regression\n\n1. **EV-1486 boundary:** Pass. It is a population-bound adjusted association, not a causal or occupational-performance prediction.\n2. **EV-1492 boundary:** Pass. It describes acute within-course changes among completers.\n3. **Statistics:** Pass. All newly stated values match the authorized human decision and result packets.\n4. **Participant flow:** Pass. The manuscript distinguishes 18 starters, 11 completers, two self-withdrawals and five medical withdrawals.\n5. **Overlap:** Pass. No shared dataset was identified from the available metadata; no stronger claim is made.\n6. **Design fit:** Pass. Both claims retain observational ceilings.\n7. **Conclusion strength:** Pass. No global conclusion was strengthened.\n8. **Global proportionality:** Pass. The conclusion remains evidence- and task-bounded.\n9. **Scientific drift:** Pass. No new drift found.\n10. **Holds:** Both can be closed because named human decisions and exact boundaries are documented.\n'''
